## 28. SEPARATION OF FINANCIAL AND HR RESPONSIBILITIES

Preserve appropriate responsibility boundaries.

The Accountant / Fee Manager manages authorized financial workflows.

The HR / Staff Manager manages authorized employment, staff attendance, leave, and recruitment workflows.

Do not give HR unrestricted access to student financial records.

Do not give the Accountant unrestricted access to confidential employee documents, leave details, or HR records.

Do not assume Admin should bypass every financial or HR approval requirement.

Respect the existing centralized permission policy.

Where approvals require another role, represent the approval state accurately.

If the demo has no separate approval role or approval workflow, do not pretend that independent approval has occurred.

